# The agent activity log — a running record for the owner to tail, not history.
logs/

# Theseus writes a dated status file per stopping point, named for the workstream key.
# `docs/HANDOFF.md` is the committed record; these are tooling state and do not belong in a
# public repository's root.
SESSION-STATUS-*.md

# Reference screenshots the owner drops here while describing what he wants. CLEANROOM.md §3
# admits other products as *observable behaviour*; a picture of their window is not ours to
# redistribute, so it is read and left out of the repository.
Screenshot*.png

# Visual Studio resource-editor artefacts from opening docs/design/*.rc by hand: a binary
# cache and an rc temp file, both regenerated on open.
docs/design/*.aps
docs/design/RCa*
